msgid "Gandi cannot be reached right now. Nothing was saved: try again later."
msgstr "Gandi kan ikkje nåast akkurat no. Ingenting vart lagra: prøv igjen seinare."

# needs-review
msgid "Gandi cannot be reached right now: try again later."
msgstr "Gandi kan ikkje nåast akkurat no: prøv igjen seinare."

# needs-review
msgid "Gandi could not give a price right now: nothing was bought. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Gandi kunne ikkje gje ein pris akkurat no: ingenting vart kjøpt. Prøv igjen om litt."

