msgstr "Denne kontoen er skriveverna: skriveoperasjonar vert avviste."

# needs-review
msgid "This account name is not valid: use 1 to 40 letters, digits, hyphens or single spaces."
msgstr ""
"Dette kontonamnet er ikkje gyldig: bruk 1 til 40 bokstavar, siffer, bindestrekar eller enkle "
"mellomrom."

# needs-review
msgid ""
"This account was made read-only in the meantime: nothing was changed. Ask again to allow write "
